FungusAchievement: {
	FriendlyName: Let there be Light
	Description: Defeat the Feudal Fungus, psychic master of the glowing mushrooms and highest in the fungal order.
}

MonarchAchievement: {
	FriendlyName: Dethroned
	Description: Defeat the Mushroom Monarch, ruler of the scarlet forest.
}

DrakeAchievement: {
	Description: Feed an Ice Drake Juvenile using a roasted bird.
	FriendlyName: Pacifist
}

SockAchievement: {
	Description: Get killed by jumping into water while wearing Socks. Why would you put yourself through such a miserable experience?
	FriendlyName: Unbearable Suffering
}

TarahaAchievement: {
	FriendlyName: Otherworldly Friend
	Description: Trade an item with Taraha. 'Might be trash to you, but holy relic for other.'
}

MindAchievement: {
	FriendlyName: Madman's Lobotomy
	Description: Defeat an ascended mind that stalks the maddened nights.
}

SmileyAchievement: {
	FriendlyName: The White Shadow
	Description: Defeat Smiley, the dark one stalked by light.
}

ToadAchievement: {
	FriendlyName: Croaked Croaker
	Description: Kill a Truffle Toad within the glowing mushroom biome
}

ShimmerFishAchievement: {
	Description: Reel in a catch while fishing in shimmer.
	FriendlyName: Fishes for Wishes
}

MadnessAchievement: {
	Description: Survive the Night of Madness, when madness gazes down to awaken those who shouldn't be.
	FriendlyName: Sturdy Mind
}

EyeAchievement: {
	Description: Obtain an Omni Eye, a cursed relic created through fusion of other magic eyes.
	FriendlyName: Eye See You
}
